om/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Based on my understanding: no. `EXBIND2RC` is just a util that wraps `GDVIRTUAL2RC_REQUIRED` while also creating the necessary virtual function in C++ to call to the gdvirtual function.\n\nSince `EXBIND2RC` is replaced with an equivalent `GDVIRTUAL2RC_REQUIRED` it should look the same to extension. All that changes is that the C++ side virtual function is now implemented explicitly since it needs to ignore an argument that extensions are not aware of.","created_at":"2026-07-03T14:04:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T14:04:55Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118324#discussion_r3520345272","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118324","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3520345272"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118324#discussion_r3520345272"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118324"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3520345272/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":372,"side":"LEFT","in_reply_to_id":3520318801,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]